1-16T10:19:38Z"}],"body":"## v3.1.5\n\nThis release contains the October/November issue fixes merged since v3.1.4.\n\n- Fix provider credential fallback, vendor-qualified model routing, stale profile model selections, and context-window/reasoning metadata discovery.\n- Preserve native Anthropic safeguards, classifier verdicts and tool-use IDs through virtual models and JSON/SSE. Profiles with internal gateway tools explicitly reject incompatible safeguards requests; upstream eligibility still controls no-charge server review.\n- Add **Restore original settings** to system-default Claude Code/Codex profiles. Recovery works with the gateway stopped, persists the disabled state, and preserves unrelated Claude settings. Client errors identify the failed provider/model and nested upstream cause.\n- Fix Codex workspace routing, shared-account credential refresh visibility, legacy per-profile auth copies and native desktop backend connections.\n- Deliver protocol-native terminal errors for interrupted native, converted and virtual-model streams. Add a provider compatibility switch for upstreams that reject deferred tool flags.\n- Bound request-log migrations and cleanup, route-script work, and large request-body processing. Improve Windows process visibility, Pi launch arguments, ToolHub stdio framing and Anthropic tool-result image conversion.\n- Update Electron to 42.11.18 and retain non-root Docker service execution.\n\n### Downloads\n\n| Platform | Installer |\n| --- | --- |\n| Windows x64 | [EXE](https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/releases/download/v3.1.5/Claude-Code-Router_3.1.5.exe) |\n| Linux x64 | [AppImage](https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/releases/download/v3.1.5/Claude-Code-Router_3.1.5.AppImage) |\n| macOS Apple Silicon | [DMG](https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/releases/download/v3.1.5/Claude-Code-Router_3.1.5-mac-Apple-Silicon-arm64.dmg) |\n| macOS Intel | [DMG](https://github.com/musistudio/claude-code-router/releases/download/v3.1.5/Claude-Code-Router_3.1.5-mac-Intel-x64.dmg) |\n\nCLI: `npm install -g @musistudio/claude-code-router@3.1.5`\n\nDocker: `musistudio/claude-code-router:3.1.5` (linux/amd64 and linux/arm64).\n\n### Validation\n\nCCR: 1,529 passed, 7 platform-specific skips. Patched gateway: 978 passed, 7 skipped. Typechecks, production builds, bilingual docs and Docker system smoke passed. Classifier validation used mock upstreams; live-account billing eligibility was not tested.\n\n中文：本版修复供应商与凭据回退、模型配置校验、Codex 账号及桌面路由、流式中断和 safeguards 透传，并新增系统默认 Agent 配置的“恢复原始设置”入口。中英文 README 下载链接同步更新。\n"}
